3, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Sribhumi 11:30 pm, what's up with this sudden crowd on Ashtami/Nabami??\n\nI thought there is not much crowd for this pandal. https://t.co/y46GBrro7z", "url": "https://x.com/lofITechie/status/2112247612514644235"}, {"author_id": "4853557994", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:14:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112245942938480841"], "id": "2112245942938480841", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1874871499334791168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112204785319592366", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@sub570530811851 @abasu4ever Come to Sreebhumi you will realise whether there is crowd or not.", "url": "https://x.com/tseringnio/status/2112245942938480841"}, {"author_id": "1677414224094695424", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:13:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112230748275282344"], "id": "2112230748275282344", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1677414224094695424", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112230744601076135", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Sreebhumi\n\nYou cannot stop reels nor can you stop anyone from entering pandels, but we have to do something about how people behave midline. It mainly starts from a group of chyangra cheles ( seems like they never had parents to teach them a lesson ) the rest of crowd follows.", "url": "https://x.com/mohunbaganlad/status/2112230748275282344"}, {"author_id": "1677414224094695424", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:13:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112230744601076135"], "id": "2112230744601076135", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 533, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Viral Reels - Influx of random people increases by many folds causing huge gatherings of uncivilized people. \n\nOver the years I have faced problems in\n\nSM Square -  Ram Mandir ( huge uncivilized crowd of non bengalis )\n\nTridhara Sammilani - Aghori (same pattern)\n\nChorBagan", "url": "https://x.com/mohunbaganlad/status/2112230744601076135"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112174526960427008"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:42:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112177593713902026"], "id": "2112177593713902026", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1291, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: Kolkata\u2019s Santosh Mitra Square Durga Puja pandal is witnessing heavy footfall, prompting authorities to deploy an AI-powered crowd management system following the Chorbagan incident. Senior police officers, personnel and volunteers are monitoring crowds and https://t.co/kRzpCcIbnN", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2112177593713902026"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112167355782742016"]}, "author_id": "1759219340178833408", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:05:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112168209965285816"], "id": "2112168209965285816", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 551, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Santosh Mitra Square \n\nReally good crowd management, but the exit was kinda suffocating. https://t.co/wtikayHDYi", "url": "https://x.com/itzme3d_1/status/2112168209965285816"}, {"author_id": "570146526", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:50:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112104137873932795"], "id": "2112104137873932795", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Things that need to be addressed-\nAllow VIP passes,No need to ban them.\nTraffic mgmt- last evening visited ballygunj cultural,samajsevi sangha,exit was on sarat bose rd side. To visit Tridhara on opp side police didn't allow to cross. Said we need 2 walk till lake mall. Absurd", "url": "https://x.com/NetNetizen/status/2112104137873932795"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112099012690251776"]}, "author_id": "22793955", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112099068810006898"], "id": "2112099068810006898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "West Bengal Fire Services has issued show-cause notices to Chetla Agrani, Tridhara Sammilani and Ballygunge Cultural Association over alleged fire safety and crowd management lapses following the Chorbagan Durga Puja stampede that killed 19 people. Officials have also ordered the https://t.co/LJ7GrCGLcq", "url": "https://x.com/indiacom/status/2112099068810006898"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097407140016128", "3_2112097407140057088", "3_2112097407182000128", "3_2112097407169437696"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097414836531229"], "id": "2112097414836531229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097205490528256", "3_2112097205490495488", "3_2112097205448495104", "3_2112097205448499200"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097213392580776"], "id": "2112097213392580776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcf0 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja\u2019s 84th edition and \u201cNISHAAN \u2014 The Mark\u201d finds a place across the press. \ud83d\ude4f\u2728\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097213392580776"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112053250153472001"]}, "author_id": "1295790336468381696", "created_at": "2026-10-19T05:28:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112053295539994715"], "id": "2112053295539994715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 220, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u0936\u093e\u0930\u0926\u0940\u092f \u0928\u0935\u0930\u093e\u0924\u094d\u0930\u093f \u0915\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0935\u0928 \u0905\u0935\u0938\u0930 \u092a\u0930 \u092e\u093e\u0902 \u0926\u0941\u0930\u094d\u0917\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u0942\u091c\u093e-\u0905\u0930\u094d\u091a\u0928\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0936\u094d\u0930\u0926\u094d\u0927\u093e\u0932\u0941\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u092d\u0940\u0921\u093c \u0909\u092e\u0921\u093c \u0930\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092d\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u092e\u093e\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u091a\u0930\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0936\u0940\u0936 \u091d\u0941\u0915\u093e\u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0941\u0916, \u0936\u093e\u0902\u0924\u093f \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u092e\u0943\u0926\u094d\u0927\u093f \u0915\u093e \u0906\u0936\u0940\u0930\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0926 \u092e\u093e\u0902\u0917 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u093f\u090f, \u0915\u0947\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0941\u0906 \u0936\u093e\u0902\u0924\u093f \u0938\u0902\u